  "description": "After being discharged from the military, Hae-Su falls head over heels for I-Jin at first sight. He even sheds the glasses he's worn for over 20 years and makes a bold move on Choi I-Jin, only to face a harsh rejection. With a heavy heart, he puts his glasses back on and reluctantly attends the end-of-term gathering. \"Hae-Su, you look quite cute with your glasses on,\" says someone unexpectedly... \n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated) \n\n*Note: Includes three side story chapters.*",
